{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116314","id":3286967418,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7D6yR6","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116314","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116314.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116314.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116314","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116314/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116314/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116314/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/14ec3cb2487c09149883c1374839905b5c0f6eb5","number":116314,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Capture XR to Texture for grabbing full eye seamlessly using compositor","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"As discussed in the XR channel, we had issues on our version of the engine capturing the viewport. This was required for a feedback system in Augmental Puzzles.\r\nOur requirements were:\r\n\r\nCapture the full eye\r\nMinimal overhead\r\nAvoid any frame hitch on XR\r\n\r\nWe implemented this purely as a Vulkan capture similar to how the screen blit is done, though in this PR I have expanded it to include GLES so I could move it into the base compositor. I have not tested the GLES side as I'm less familiar with that part of the code, so it could definitely use a review by someone more familiar with that side.\r\nI've sketched out rough docs and a demo.\r\n\r\nDemo project using the feature:\r\n[blit-capture-demo.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25325395/blit-capture-demo.zip)\r\n\r\nAI Disclosure: Claude Opus was used to review this code and help me with the GLES conversion (as I'm less familiar with Godot's GLES implementation), though I have reviewed all the code and there is no direct slop in here. I also used it to write a first draft and spell-check my edits on the docs.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/470